nges. As you uncover the secrets of a once-great civilization buried beneath the sands, you\u2019ll need to leverage your strategic prowess and resourcefulness to protect your base and ensure the survival of your people. With its compelling blend of strategy, resource management, and survival elements, Sands of Supremacy promises an engaging and intense gameplay experience that will keep you on the edge of your seat. Are you ready to lead your people to supremacy in the harshest of environments? The sands await your command!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952260/extras/20bc0f90d76b74ac511086db3a80d250.poster.avif?t=1754956512\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952260/extras/20bc0f90d76b74ac511086db3a80d250.webm?t=1754956512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2952260/extras/20bc0f90d76b74ac511086db3a80d250.mp4?t=1754956512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
